and anyone goes down with one shot. You, enemies, or your base. Be precise, don't be an easy target.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solo or Co-Op </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or in couch co-op. Help each other, compete with each other, invent new strategies. </p>","developers":["Luminous Lore"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751560/6878066bd4bddafc8be1e6c1d4c70fde6449033d/header.jpg?t=1772901905","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Luminous Lore. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2751560/1146376024/becf856a851d8af1f17d59d51e5816e6bc0f2d19/1764623047/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764625451","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2751560/1146376024/becf856a851d8af1f17d59d51e5816e6bc0f2d19/1764623047/dash_h264.mpd?t=1764625451","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2751560/1146376024/becf856a851d8af1f17d59d51e5816e6bc0f2d19/1764623047/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1764625451","id":257177781,"name":"Gameplay trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257177781/bae1b3dbfab9547382d1bb693e07ed2d99d9fc8c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1764625451"}],"name":"Decurion","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows Vista/Windows 7/Windows 8/Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Radeon HD5450 or better; 256 MB or higher<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Luminous Lore"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia fantasiosa","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gat